{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01539","headline":"琴曲歌辞 别鹤 · 杨巨源","name":"琴曲歌辞 别鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海鹤一爲别，高程方杳然。\n影摇江海路，思结潇湘天。\n皎然仰白日，真姿栖紫烟。\n含情九霄际，顾侣五云前。\n遐心属清都，凄响激朱弦。\n超摇间云雨，迢遰各山川。\n东南信多水，会合当有年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}